{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "gi",
  "id": "ballads-of-the-squire",
  "name": "Ballads of the Squire",
  "sourceUrl": "https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Ballads_of_the_Squire",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-15T09:07:35.239Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "vol-1",
      "label": "Vol. 1",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Down every street in Mondstadt have I strolled."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The air was filled with the stench of misery and the buzz of revelry."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I saw the most arrogant of aristocrats,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And I saw the most pitiful of the impoverished."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "At night these streets are a spider's web—some here to feast, others their eternal prey."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I hear a jangling in the night, and know it is the chains that fetter the souls of the oppressed."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3bd6c9ec8cbb58e0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I patrol the streets of Mondstadt at nighttime,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Where my peers and superiors would once declare:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"We are the starlit knights, lift thy heads and bear witness!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"For we, who raise our flag in the splendor of starlight, are the true protectors of Mondstadt!\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But not once have I lifted my head to the stars, or gazed at our flag:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "For I cannot shift my focus from the filthy street corners."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0cad881131a74a14"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Destitute peddlers weep in silence."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Aging soldiers grimace in pain."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the deathly stillness of night,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A young girl, rejected by the Aristocracy, pleads for Barbatos' mercy."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The sighing of mournful winds rattles the Cathedral gate,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Carrying within them the grief of the oppressed, they assault splendid palatial walls."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cd7327412f1016ed"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Each mother's call,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Each infant's cry,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Enough to dent the hardest of shields."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Enough to shatter the sharpest of swords."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2a2bb2df2c6b87e3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sounds of sorrow send shivers down my spine."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But in the palace, and in the castle,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Though the wind blows the same over holy ground,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "They are but the sighs of ants to the ears of men."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7989bbc11df06f76"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "vol-2",
      "label": "Vol. 2",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "One day, at the crack of dawn,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A dancer whose sword was her song set foot in Mondstadt."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Though clad in chains with cuffed hands and fettered feet,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In her silence lay a song:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was the song of freedom. A song of a brighter dawn beyond the walls,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A joyous ballad sung without reservation by a people unrestrained."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f6142551d8a6567c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She was the dawnlight of the Wanderer's Troupe,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But she spelled eternal midnight for the Aristocracy."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I once asked her, \"Why do you come to overthrow our aristocrats?\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Do you not know that they are the first among us?\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-136ab7af6f98e3f7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Wherefore do you place their lives on a pedestal?\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Came her voice, like a fresh breeze,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"If you claim to know the wind as your companion,\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Then did you not once know freedom, too?\""
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fe50736fd64c0b44"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To her lonesome listeners she told a tale:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A tale of our rulers' better ancestors who held divine power,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A tale of angels, gods and vile dragons,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A tale of the deities and peoples of all the land."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Each myth and legend she turned to song,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And the wind carried the song to all corners of the land."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-42f5d807ccee58b0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the aristocrats' arena, her sword sang once more:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Her final masterpiece, but it stopped short of perfection."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A nameless knight retrieved her sword from the blood-soaked battlefield."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And buried it where the gentle winds meet in communion."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e08b026899a8ad66"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
